[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0823","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0823.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59224","title":"Open WebUI 终端代理用户身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 终端代理存在身份认证绕过漏洞。在 `backend/open_webui/routers/terminals.py` 中，HTTP 路径将用户 ID 以未签名的 `X-User-Id` 标头转发至上游，攻击者可直接伪造该标头冒充任意用户；WebSocket 路径未对 `session_id` 参数进行校验与 URL 编码，攻击者可通过注入特殊字符篡改上游 URL 中的 `user_id` 查询参数，使后端协调器解析为其他用户的终端作用域。已认证的普通用户可利用此漏洞越权访问其他用户的终端会话，结合共享聊天中泄露的会话 ID 可附加到目标用户的实时 PTY。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI 0.10.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.0，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59224","GHSA-j657-m4c4-24jq"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-10T15:22:04Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本（该版本已对 session_id 进行 URL 编码校验并废弃无签名的 X-User-Id 转发机制）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则过滤请求路径中携带的 `?`、`#`、`&` 等特殊字符，并限制终端代理上游仅接受来自可信来源的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/5f3a628a8d291bb5d33e1a0b0c89fb62a2927934","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26042","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-j657-m4c4-24jq","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2026-59224.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln_en/openwebui/CVE-2026-59224.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59224.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59224.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59224.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59224.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59224.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59224.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0823.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0823.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0822","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0822.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59223","title":"Open WebUI WEB_FETCH_FILTER_LIST 主机过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款可扩展、功能丰富且用户友好的自托管 AI 平台。其 WEB_FETCH_FILTER_LIST（服务端网页抓取的允许/阻止列表）存在主机名匹配缺陷：is_string_allowed 函数使用 str.endswith() 进行匹配，且调用时传入的是完整 URL 而非主机名。攻击者可通过在 URL 路径中添加目标域名绕过阻止列表（如 !internal.example.com 无法匹配带路径的 URL），或利用非标签边界匹配绕过允许列表（如 evilcorp.com 匹配 corp.com）。已认证用户可利用此漏洞访问管理员意图阻止的公开可解析主机，造成受限的 SSRF 信息泄露。该漏洞在 Open WebUI 0.10.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59223","GHSA-qg3f-8x3j-ggf2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-10T17:39:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本（对应 commit 087878ce8）。如无法升级，在 `WEB_FETCH_FILTER_LIST` 中同时配置主机名和完整 URL 路径作为临时缓解，并确保 `ENABLE_RAG_LOCAL_WEB_FETCH` 保持关闭（默认值）以启用 SSRF 防护层。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/087878ce848a4d828012068b5997dac480f43656","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/25949","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-qg3f-8x3j-ggf2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59223.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59223.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59223.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59223.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59223.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59223.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59223.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59223.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59223.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/13ed3f592a10631c0caaa49cbae4f7b3f5d02049/2026/CVE-2026-59223.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0822.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0822.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0821","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0821.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59222","title":"Open WebUI 频道成员接口敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 的频道成员接口存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。在 0.7.0 至 0.10.0 版本中，`/api/v1/channels/{id}/members` 端点返回完整的 UserModel 对象，包含用户的 settings.ui.toolServers[].key 和 webhook 配置等敏感凭据。低权限攻击者只需创建一个与管理员用户的私信频道，即可通过该接口获取管理员的工具服务器 Bearer Token 和 Webhook URL，进而控制集成服务。该漏洞源于接口未对返回的敏感字段进行过滤，CVSS 评分 6.0，需启用 Channels 功能方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59222","GHSA-gh7p-78x6-jw6m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-10T17:43:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或以上版本（对应 commit fbcdcf1），该版本已限制 `/api/v1/channels/{id}/members` 接口仅返回非敏感用户信息。如无法立即升级，建议在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则拦截对 `/api/v1/channels/*/members` 的 GET 请求，或暂时关闭 Channels（Beta）功能以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/fbcdcf146b99b5002705060a8243eee769108f9e","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-gh7p-78x6-jw6m","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-59222.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59222.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59222.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59222.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59222.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59222.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59222.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59222.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59222.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59222.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0821.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0821.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0819","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0819.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59220","title":"Open WebUI 技能提及正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 在 0.9.2 至 0.10.0 版本中存在正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞（ReDoS）。后端 `backend/open_webui/utils/middleware.py` 中用于解析 `<$skillId|label>` 技能提及标签的两个正则表达式 `SKILL_MENTION_RE` 和 `strip_re` 存在重叠量词问题，导致在输入包含 `<$` 后跟大量无闭合 `>` 字符时触发 O(n²) 级回溯。这两个正则表达式在每次聊天完成时无条件同步执行于 asyncio 事件循环中，默认单 uvicorn 工作进程部署下，任意认证用户只需发送一条包含恶意模式的消息即可使单个 CPU 核心满载，导致整个实例对所有用户停止响应。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI 0.9.2 至 0.9.6 版本，已在 v0.10.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59220","GHSA-ffpj-xv5c-p3gw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:15:48Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本（`docker pull ghcr.io/open-webui/open-webui:v0.10.0` 或 `pip install open-webui>=0.10.0`）。如无法升级，手动将 `backend/open_webui/utils/middleware.py` 中 `SKILL_MENTION_RE` 和 `strip_re` 的正则表达式替换为修复版本（commit 61a2672），将 `[^|>]+\\|?[^>]*` 改为 `[^|>]+(?:\\|[^>]*)?` 和 `[^|>]+\\|?([^>]*)` 改为 `[^|>]+(?:\\|([^>]*))?>` 以消除二次回溯。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/61a26722155ec6ee1b629cf8dfcf975098c18331","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-ffpj-xv5c-p3gw","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-59220.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59220.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59220.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59220.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59220.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59220.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/8536e9d1bbb33a321f6d4a80a182400d5e74bd28/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59220.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59220.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59220.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59220.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0819.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0819.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0819.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0818","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0818.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59219","title":"Open WebUI 实时端点 JWT 撤销验证缺失漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 在配置 Redis 的情况下，其实时通信端点（Socket.IO 连接/用户加入/频道加入/笔记加入及终端 WebSocket）在认证时仅调用 decode_token 验证 JWT 签名和过期时间，未执行 Redis 中的撤销检查（is_valid_token），导致用户注销或 OIDC 反向通道注销后已撤销的 JWT 仍可建立新的实时连接。攻击者可利用已泄露但已撤销的令牌继续访问受害者的实时频道消息、协作笔记更新及终端会话，造成敏感信息泄露和会话劫持风险。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI >=0.9.0 且 <0.10.0 且配置 Redis 的版本，已在 v0.10.0 中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59219","GHSA-855v-hq7w-jmjw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:17:21Z","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本，该版本在 Socket.IO 连接和终端 WebSocket 认证中增加了 Redis 撤销令牌检查。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 Redis 的 JWT 撤销功能或限制实时 WebSocket 端点的网络访问作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/33b91bd8ae8a100a5a306c91441a7d0b422c4cde","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-855v-hq7w-jmjw","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-59219.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59219.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59219.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59219.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59219.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59219.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a8362e19858624e897b48186cc604f19ab09814c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59219.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59219.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59219.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59219.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0818.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0817","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0817.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59218","title":"Open WebUI 登录接口响应时间侧信道账户枚举漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 登录接口 `/api/v1/auths/signin` 存在基于响应时间差异的账户枚举漏洞。当用户邮箱存在于数据库中时，后端会执行 bcrypt 密码哈希比对（耗时约 180ms）；若邮箱不存在则直接返回（耗时约 5ms）。未认证的远程攻击者可通过测量登录请求的响应时间差异，枚举出已注册的合法账户邮箱，进而针对确认存在的账户进行密码喷洒攻击。该漏洞源于认证流程中未对不存在的邮箱执行恒定的哈希比对操作，属于典型的侧信道信息泄露。影响 Open WebUI 0.10.0 之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59218","GHSA-7rw5-9f7q-xj36"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:30:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本，该版本在邮箱不存在时也会执行 bcrypt 哈希比较，消除响应时间差异。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）对 /api/v1/auths/signin 端点添加统一延迟中间件，并启用 MFA 以降低账户枚举后的密码喷射攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/993e74912199c66c522f08ec81abe31d76985e39","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26385","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-7rw5-9f7q-xj36","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59218.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59218.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59218.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59218.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a8362e19858624e897b48186cc604f19ab09814c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59218.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59218.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59218.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59218.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59218.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2026/CVE-2026-59218.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0817.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0817.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0816","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0816.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59217","title":"Open WebUI 知识库文件上传权限绕过漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 文件上传功能存在授权检查缺失漏洞。服务端在处理文件上传时直接信任客户端提交的 `metadata.knowledge_id` 字段，在未验证当前用户对目标知识库是否拥有写入权限的情况下，即创建文件与知识库的关联记录。已通过身份验证但仅拥有知识库只读权限的攻击者，可通过在文件上传请求中构造恶意 `metadata` 参数，将任意文件添加至目标知识库，导致知识库文件列表被未授权篡改。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI 0.10.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。官方已在 0.10.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59217","GHSA-7r7x-gjvr-448g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-14T02:16:57Z","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本，该版本在文件上传自动关联知识库的路径中增加了写入权限检查。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 `/api/v1/files/` 接口添加额外访问控制，限制只读用户的上传操作，或禁用 `metadata.knowledge_id` 参数传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/b7626f05fb92b24ab923ad81a037071ebd5623d1","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26001","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-7r7x-gjvr-448g","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2026-59217.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln_en/openwebui/CVE-2026-59217.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59217.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59217.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59217.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59217.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a8362e19858624e897b48186cc604f19ab09814c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59217.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59217.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59217.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59217.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0816.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0816.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0816.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0815","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0815.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59216","title":"Open WebUI 跨用户会话代码执行漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 存在跨用户会话劫持漏洞，源于 Socket.IO 事件调用器 `get_event_call` 未验证 `session_id` 归属，仅检查会话是否在线即将 `execute:python`/`execute:tool` 事件投递至客户端提供的任意会话 ID。低权限认证攻击者可通过共享笔记的 `ydoc:document:join` 机制获取目标用户的实时 Socket ID，进而劫持其会话执行任意代码解释器 Python 脚本或工具。若目标为管理员，攻击者可利用劫持的管理员上下文调用 Functions API 创建恶意函数，其源码在服务端通过 `exec()` 执行，最终实现远程代码执行（默认容器中为 root 权限）。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI v0.10.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59216","GHSA-74h3-cxq7-vc5q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-13T12:24:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本（`docker pull ghcr.io/open-webui/open-webui:latest` 后重启容器）。如无法立即升级，在反向代理层限制 `/api/v1/chat/completions` 接口仅允许受信来源访问，并禁用代码解释器功能（关闭 Code Interpreter 开关）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/386ac958144dbbbf0aa6e268070d72b681a318aa","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/25763","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-74h3-cxq7-vc5q","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-59216.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2026-59216.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln_en/openwebui/CVE-2026-59216.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59216.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59216.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59216.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59216.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59216.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a8362e19858624e897b48186cc604f19ab09814c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59216.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59216.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0815.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0814","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0814.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59215","title":"Open WebUI 跨频道线程消息权限绕过漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款自托管的 AI 平台，其频道线程消息处理功能存在授权绕过漏洞（CWE-639）。在 0.10.0 之前版本中，`get_messages_by_parent_id()` 函数在加载线程父消息时仅通过消息 ID 查询，未校验该父消息是否属于当前请求的频道。已认证的攻击者只需知道目标私有频道中某条消息的 ID，即可通过访问自己有权查看的频道线程接口 `GET /api/v1/channels/{id}/messages/{message_id}/thread`，将受害者消息 ID 作为 `parent_id` 传入，从而跨频道读取私有频道或私信频道的消息内容、频道 ID 及作者信息。该漏洞利用条件较高（需知晓目标消息 ID），仅影响机密性，CVSS 评分 3.1，危害等级低。官方已在 v0.10.0 版本中修复，修复方式为在查询父消息时增加 `parent.channel_id == channel_id` 的频道绑定校验。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59215","GHSA-73x5-h92w-xc2j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-13T12:27:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本（PR #25766）。该版本在 `get_messages_by_parent_id` 中增加了 `parent.channel_id == channel_id` 校验，并在 `new_message_handler` 中拒绝跨通道的 `parent_id`/`reply_to_id`。如无法立即升级，可临时限制 `/api/v1/channels/{id}/messages/{message_id}/thread` 接口的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/a66477b7104c5d141ce7bffaea424b43e7666ef1","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/25766","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-73x5-h92w-xc2j","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-59215.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2026-59215.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln_en/openwebui/CVE-2026-59215.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59215.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59215.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59215.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59215.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59215.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a8362e19858624e897b48186cc604f19ab09814c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59215.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59215.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0814.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0814.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0813","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0813.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59214","title":"Open WebUI Pyodide Web Worker 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 在 0.10.0 之前版本中，客户端 Python 执行引擎 Pyodide 运行在同源 Web Worker 内，导致存储型跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。低权限攻击者可将恶意 Python 载荷（利用 pyodide.http.pyfetch 或 js 模块的 fetch/XMLHttpRequest API）存入共享聊天消息中，当受害者（尤其是管理员或拥有 workspace.functions/workspace.tools 权限的用户）打开该聊天并点击\"运行\"按钮时，载荷以受害者身份发起同源认证请求，可调用管理员接口创建服务端执行的 Function/Tool，最终实现远程代码执行（RCE）。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高，影响所有使用 Pyodide 的 Open WebUI 部署版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59214","GHSA-4r2p-27mh-5m22"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:24:29Z","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 0.10.0 或更高版本，该版本将 Pyodide 运行在沙箱化 iframe（opaque origin）中，阻止同源请求携带会话 cookie。如无法立即升级，可禁用 Pyodide 代码执行功能，或将代码执行/代码解释器引擎切换为服务端选项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-4r2p-27mh-5m22","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2026-59214.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln_en/openwebui/CVE-2026-59214.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59214.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59214.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59214.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59214.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a8362e19858624e897b48186cc604f19ab09814c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59214.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59214.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-09/TIER_2_CVE-2026-59214.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59214.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0813.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0812","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0812.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59213","title":"Open WebUI 跨用户模型列表暴露漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 的 `get_all_models` 处理函数在 `routers/openai.py` 和 `routers/ollama.py` 中使用了 aiocache 的 `@cached` 装饰器，但错误地将 `key=` 参数传入了 lambda 表达式而非 `key_builder=` 参数。在 aiocache 0.12.3 中，`key=` 被当作静态缓存键处理，导致所有用户的权限过滤模型列表共享同一个缓存条目。已认证的攻击者可在默认 1 秒的缓存 TTL 窗口内，通过连续请求获取其他用户的模型列表，从而越权查看本应受限的模型信息。该漏洞影响 Open WebUI 0.6.27 至 0.10.0 版本，CVSS 评分 3.5，危害等级低，已在 0.10.0 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59213","GHSA-3wp3-xxj9-5jqq"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:49:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或以上版本，该版本已将 `routers/openai.py` 和 `routers/ollama.py` 中 `@cached` 装饰器的 `key=` 参数替换为 `key_builder=`，确保每个用户的模型列表缓存按 `user.id` 隔离。如无法立即升级，可将 `MODELS_CACHE_TTL` 设为 0 以禁用缓存，或通过反向代理限制 `/api/models` 等接口的并发请求频率作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/0fc630b34b2899599dabffffa012afd47599aa75","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/25783","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-3wp3-xxj9-5jqq","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2026-59213.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/5860f042b5c19b8faa0bc408fc348118590651b6/data/vuln_en/openwebui/CVE-2026-59213.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59213.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59213.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59213.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59213.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a8362e19858624e897b48186cc604f19ab09814c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59213.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59213.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-59213.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59213.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0812.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0812.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0811","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0811.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59212","title":"Open WebUI 文件授权不当导致权限提升漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 0.9.6 至 0.10.0 之前版本存在授权绕过漏洞（CWE-863）。`_verify_knowledge_file_access` 函数仅校验用户对文件的读取权限，而文件写入和删除路由后续通过可写模型 `meta.knowledge` 条目派生访问权限，导致拥有知识库只读权限的认证用户可将文件 ID 附加到攻击者控制的模型元数据中，从而将只读权限升级为文件写入或删除权限。攻击者需具备 Models 工作区访问权限且已通过知识库授权获得目标文件的只读权限，利用条件中等。成功利用后攻击者可重命名、覆盖或删除其他用户的文件，影响数据的完整性和可用性。该漏洞在 v0.10.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59212","GHSA-2xwm-4h2q-ggfx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T17:17:01Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:59:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.10.0 或更高版本（对应 commit 17df0264）。如无法升级，在反向代理层限制非管理员用户对 `POST /api/v1/files/{id}/rename`、`POST /api/v1/files/{id}/data/content/update`、`DELETE /api/v1/files/{id}` 三个端点的访问，并审查所有拥有 Models 工作区权限的用户的模型 meta.knowledge 配置，移除非本人所有的文件 ID 引用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/17df0264929514599dbcb21c6578bcdfa204b04d","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/pull/26032","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.10.0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-2xwm-4h2q-ggfx"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0811.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0811.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0238","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-12590","title":"body-parser 无效limit值绕过请求体大小限制导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"body-parser 在处理请求体大小时存在安全缺陷，当应用程序配置了无效的 `limit` 参数值（如无法解析的字符串或 `NaN`）时，`bytes.parse()` 函数会返回 `null` 而非抛出错误，导致请求体大小限制被静默绕过。攻击者可利用此缺陷发送超大型请求体，耗尽服务器内存与 CPU 资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 body-parser 1.x 系列低于 1.20.6 及 2.x 系列低于 2.3.0 的版本。已在 1.20.6 和 2.3.0 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-12590","GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T11:16:24Z","updated":"2026-07-10T02:45:02Z","remediation":"升级 body-parser 至 1.20.6 或 2.3.0 及以上版本，这些版本会在传入无效 limit 值时抛出明确错误而非静默跳过校验。如无法升级，在传入 limit 值前进行校验，确保其可被正确解析为有效数字，拒绝 null 或非有限数值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/expressjs/body-parser/security/advisories/GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/body-parser/CVE-2026-12590.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-12590","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-12590.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-12590.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6/GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-12590.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/catalog/blob/2c3e722611b3943559eb16bcbf05371880a9d029/image/unleash/debian-13/8-dev.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0871","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0871.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59930","title":"Mistune toc/TableOfContents 可预测标题ID生成漏洞","description":"Mistune Python Markdown 解析器的 toc 插件和 TableOfContents 指令在生成标题锚点 ID 时存在可预测标识符漏洞。默认情况下，标题 ID 采用 `toc_1`、`toc_2` 等纯序号格式，未使用标题文本内容进行 slug 化处理。攻击者若能在文档中注入带有 `id=\"toc_N\"` 属性的 HTML 元素（例如通过 `escape=False` 模式或 include 指令的 HTML 分支），即可与合法标题产生 ID 冲突，导致同页导航链接被劫持、CSS 选择器误匹配至攻击者控制的内容、JavaScript 的 `getElementById` 操作指向错误元素。该漏洞影响所有使用默认 `heading_id` 回调的 Mistune 版本（<3.3.0），攻击前提是应用启用了 TOC 功能且攻击者能向文档中植入任意 HTML 元素。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59930","GHSA-2hm2-hc3v-44h9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 mistune 至 3.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade mistune`），该版本已将标题 ID 改为基于文本内容的 slug 生成方式。如无法升级，可在调用 `add_toc_hook` 或 `TableOfContents` 时传入自定义 `heading_id` 回调函数，使用 slugified 标题文本替代默认的 `toc_N` 序号方案，并避免在文档中允许用户注入原始 HTML 的 `id` 属性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/c4093c4742ed0d10d9332fb8edb455869b7b581b","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-2hm2-hc3v-44h9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59930.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59930.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/af40efb9edec57bf6185768469537f08d820bc42/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59930.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59930.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59930.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59930.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59930.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59930.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-599xx/CVE-2026-59930.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0871.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0330","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49866","title":"libp2p @libp2p/gossipsub CPU拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libp2p的gossipsub模块在处理IHAVE和IWANT控制消息时存在未限制消息ID数量的缺陷。攻击者可向受影响的节点发送包含大量（约18万个）随机消息ID的4MB帧，导致节点同步迭代所有消息ID，阻塞Node.js事件循环约200毫秒。IHAVE变体需要约10个Sybil节点才能完全阻塞事件循环（阻塞时间超过心跳周期），而IWANT变体无速率限制，单个节点即可持续占用80%以上事件循环。该漏洞影响所有使用默认配置的@libp2p/gossipsub节点，包括以太坊共识客户端（如Lodestar）、启用pubsub的IPFS节点及任何调用createLibp2p并配置gossipsub服务的应用。攻击条件为节点接受入站连接且未自定义decodeRpcLimits参数。利用方式为连接目标节点并持续发送特制的超大IHAVE或IWANT控制消息。已在16.0.0版本中通过设置合理的解码限制修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49866","GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T21:16:49Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:10:59Z","remediation":"升级 @libp2p/gossipsub 至 16.0.0 或更高版本，该版本将 maxIhaveMessageIDs 和 maxIwantMessageIDs 默认值从 Infinity 改为 5000，限制单帧迭代的消息 ID 数量。若暂时无法升级，可在创建 gossipsub 实例时显式配置 decodeRpcLimits 参数，将 maxIhaveMessageIDs 和 maxIwantMessageIDs 设置为有限值（如 5000）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/commit/773dd80ded24dbd6b19e675c89fd2f3b45f2d899","https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/pull/3520","https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/releases/tag/gossipsub-v16.0.0","https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p/security/advisories/GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49866.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49866.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/@libp2p/gossipsub/CVE-2026-49866.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-49866-libp2p-cpu-dos-via-oversized-ihave-and-iwant-control-message-arrays.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-49866.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49866.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv/GHSA-cwc9-cp4j-mcvv.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0330.toml"}]